@startuml
'https://plantuml.com/sequence-diagram

hide footbox
autonumber

title US019 SSD - As a User, I want to publicly share a list of mine

actor User
participant ":System" as System

activate User
activate System

User --> System: I want to publicly share a list

System --> User: Select list! (lists)

User --> System: Selected! (listID)

System --> User: Done!

@enduml